      "sequence_position": 1,
      "problem": "Suppose $|\\,t\\,|=\\sqrt{2}$ and the angle between vectors $t$ and $u$ is $\\theta =\\frac{3\\pi }{4}.$ Find the scalar projection of $t$ onto $u.$\n\n${\\text{comp}}_{u}\\,t=$\n{{field-1}}",
